    "detailed_description": "<i>OscarWildeCard</i> is a fast paced card battler that is easy to learn but has surprising depth.<br><br><i>&quot;one of my favourite short games of the year&quot; - Gay Time's Best And Queerest Video Games of 2023</i><br><br><i>Top 5 Game in the Queer Games Bundle 2023 - Gamecity Hamburg</i><br><br><i>&quot;hilarious&quot; - jimjimmyjimjim</i><br><br>A new life awaits you in The Golden Palace, the world's most exclusive apartment building.<br><br>But standing in the way of social success is Oscar Wildecard, the witty but cruel socialite.<br><br>To progress to the top of the building and victory you must co-host a series of dinner parties. Battle by inviting the best guests to your side of the table, each represented by a card.<br><br>Guests have strengths and weaknesses depending on who they are and with whom they sit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.poster.avif?t=1717049219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.webm?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.mp4?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Defend, attack, or throw the rules of the game out the window with special Wildecards. The choices are yours. Just remember, always forgive your enemies, nothing will annoy them more.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode with 15 levels and an estimated 90 minutes of play.<br></li><li>Conquest mode -- play a series of challenge quests with special rules.<br></li><li>Hilarious and handsome images by comic-book artist Joe Phillips.<br></li><li>No in-app purchases. All cards are unlocked as you play.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.poster.avif?t=1717049219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.webm?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.mp4?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>OscarWildeCard</i> is a fast paced card battler that is easy to learn but has surprising depth.<br><br><i>&quot;one of my favourite short games of the year&quot; - Gay Time's Best And Queerest Video Games of 2023</i><br><br><i>Top 5 Game in the Queer Games Bundle 2023 - Gamecity Hamburg</i><br><br><i>&quot;hilarious&quot; - jimjimmyjimjim</i><br><br>A new life awaits you in The Golden Palace, the world's most exclusive apartment building.<br><br>But standing in the way of social success is Oscar Wildecard, the witty but cruel socialite.<br><br>To progress to the top of the building and victory you must co-host a series of dinner parties. Battle by inviting the best guests to your side of the table, each represented by a card.<br><br>Guests have strengths and weaknesses depending on who they are and with whom they sit!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.poster.avif?t=1717049219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.webm?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/b67522d700e4fe67d5c6ddad3f702182.mp4?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Defend, attack, or throw the rules of the game out the window with special Wildecards. The choices are yours. Just remember, always forgive your enemies, nothing will annoy them more.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode with 15 levels and an estimated 90 minutes of play.<br></li><li>Conquest mode -- play a series of challenge quests with special rules.<br></li><li>Hilarious and handsome images by comic-book artist Joe Phillips.<br></li><li>No in-app purchases. All cards are unlocked as you play.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.poster.avif?t=1717049219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.webm?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/892840/extras/8d549910a85ad0e4170096649a71ed50.mp4?t=1717049219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
